    "datasets-0.0.9", "Metadata-Version: 2.0\nName: datasets\nVersion: 0.0.9\nSummary: The CORGIS Datasets Project for Python\nHome-page: https://github.com/realtimeweb/datasets\nAuthor: Austin Cory Bart\nAuthor-email: acbart@vt.edu\nLicense: MIT\nKeywords: data science datasets corgis\nPlatform: UNKNOWN\nClassifier: Development Status :: 3 - Alpha\nClassifier: Intended Audience :: Education\nClassifier: Topic :: Education\nClassifier: License :: OSI Approved :: MIT License\nClassifier: Programming Language :: Python :: 2\nClassifier: Programming Language :: Python :: 2.6\nClassifier: Programming Language :: Python :: 2.7\nClassifier: Programming Language :: Python :: 3\nClassifier: Programming Language :: Python :: 3.2\nClassifier: Programming Language :: Python :: 3.3\nClassifier: Programming Language :: Python :: 3.4\nProvides-Extra: test\nProvides-Extra: dev\n\nThis project collects a ton of datasets, intended to organize them into a generalized, pip-installable architecture.\n\n\n\n",
  ),
