///|
/// Documents where this library deliberately answers differently from the
/// reference implementation, as `(case name, does the reference accept it)`.
/// `metadata_cases/divergences.txt` explains each one and is checked against
/// the reference implementation when this fixture is generated, so an entry
/// that stops being a divergence fails the generator instead of being
/// tolerated. The harness asserts the two answers really do differ, in the
/// recorded direction.
